      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://largohistoricalsociety.org/category/local-history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Harbor Bluffs, once part of Largo, grew along the waterfront and now lies in unincorporated Pinellas County.",
